/*
 * NOTE: HDMI endpoints (hdmi0_in_vp0, vp0_out_hdmi0) are already defined
 * in mainline and board DTS files. Additional video port endpoints (vp1, vp2, vp3)
 * can be added by board DTS files when needed for multi-display configurations.
 */
